  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void RegisterConnectionStateHandler (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"ns_log_ara_log_10815c.html#SWS_LOG_00265\">ConnectionStateHandler</a> callback) noexcept;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Register a callback to be invoked whenever the connection state changes. Only a single function can be installed this way; if a callback was already registered before, only the newly registered one is used henceforth.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
